message: "If you use these computational materials, please cite this software release."
type: software
title: "Texture recognition with cross-products of block similarities: code and reproducibility data"
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Zeglazi
    given-names: Oussama
  - family-names: Rziza
