abstract: >-
  Research code, derived descriptors, split definitions, predictions and
  numerical verification materials for texture-recognition experiments
  involving block similarities and their cross-products. The manuscript and
  supplementary document are not included. Existing component-specific
  licences and third-party terms remain applicable; this archive does not
  introduce a repository-wide reuse licence.
repository-code: "https://github.com/ZEGLAZI/texture-cross-products-code"
url: "https://github.com/ZEGLAZI/texture-cross-products-code"
license-url: "https://github.com/ZEGLAZI/texture-cross-products-code/blob/main/README.md#data-provenance-and-licences"
keywords:
  - texture recognition
  - block similarities
  - cross-products
  - kernel methods
  - reproducibility
